<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Watch! for the morning is breaking,</l><l>A moment, the crown will be won!</l><l>A moment, and we shall be with Him,</l><l>A moment, the journey is done!</l><l>Lord, keep us each moment unsleeping,</l><l>And count us all worthy to be</l><l>In that noble band of Thy watchers,</l><l>Whose life is a vigil with Thee.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
